      }
    },
    "Tap a fillable text field to type, or tap a checkbox to select it. Pinch to zoom and swipe to move between pages. If an area does not accept typing, use Markup to write on it." : {
      "comment" : "Step 2 in the \"Fill out a form\" section of the app guide.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Toca un campo de texto rellenable para escribir o una casilla para seleccionarla. Pellizca para cambiar el zoom y desliza para pasar de una página a otra. Si un área no permite escribir con el teclado, usa Marcado para escribir sobre ella."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Share at the top of the editor. Choose Save to Files, pick a folder, and tap Save; or choose Mail, Messages, AirDrop, or another available app and finish sending there. Sharing does not automatically submit the form to your company." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing how to save or send a completed form.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
